WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.912 --> 00:00:06.155
<v Alice>Water is pouring through my kitchen ceiling

2
00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:07.692
<v Alice>and it's spreading fast.

3
00:00:08.302 --> 00:00:12.456
<v AI agent>Urgent: active leak at Maple Court, unit 4B, reported 11:42 PM.

4
00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:16.273
<v AI agent>Tenant said: Water is pouring through my kitchen ceiling

5
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:18.262
<v AI agent>and it's spreading fast.

6
00:00:19.105 --> 00:00:20.785
<v Morgan>I've got it — on my way.

7
00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:22.145
<v AI agent>Thanks, Morgan.

8
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.823
<v Narrator>Contextual on-call pager.

9
00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:32.987
<v Narrator>When it's urgent, it pages the on-call tech with the context already attached.

10
00:00:37.442 --> 00:00:40.218
<v Dee>The heat is out in unit 11 at Pine Terrace

11
00:00:40.298 --> 00:00:43.782
<v Dee>and it's 52 degrees in here. You can let yourself in.

12
00:00:44.316 --> 00:00:45.826
<v AI agent>Understood — no heat.

13
00:00:48.608 --> 00:00:53.168
<v Grace>The heat is out in my bedroom, but it's about 64 degrees inside.

14
00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.577
<v AI agent>This isn't urgent enough to page the on-call technician,

15
00:00:56.657 --> 00:00:58.846
<v AI agent>so I've logged a work order for the office.

16
00:00:58.926 --> 00:01:00.750
<v AI agent>They'll follow up Monday morning.

17
00:01:05.025 --> 00:01:07.838
<v AI agent>Please avoid unsafe heating sources such as ovens

18
00:01:07.918 --> 00:01:09.695
<v AI agent>or outdoor heaters indoors.

19
00:01:15.165 --> 00:01:16.065
<v Priya>I've got it.

20
00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:17.135
<v AI agent>Thanks, Priya.

21
00:01:23.017 --> 00:01:26.907
<v AI agent>Is the number ending 0101 the best one to call you back on?

22
00:01:28.353 --> 00:01:30.163
<v Alice>Yes, that's my cell.

23
00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:32.940
<v AI agent>I'm contacting the on-call technician now.

24
00:01:35.632 --> 00:01:38.819
<v AI agent>Contoso maintenance has an urgent page for you.

25
00:01:38.899 --> 00:01:42.462
<v AI agent>Please call the maintenance line. Reference 2 4 6 0.

26
00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:46.743
<v Narrator>The model listens.

27
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.600
<v Narrator>The server decides who wakes up.

28
00:01:53.433 --> 00:01:54.493
<v Narrator>Make it yours.

29
00:01:54.933 --> 00:02:02.743
<v Narrator>Triage rules, rotations and timers are configuration. Your coding agent can change the rest.

30
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.563
<v Narrator>Run it in simulation in two minutes.

31
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.780
<v Narrator>Then add your technicians and your Teams number.
